  (wire (pts (xy 426.72 370.84) (xy 433.07 370.84)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "202dc973-09c5-59a1-b787-844dae91f3ae"))
  (wire (pts (xy 419.1 382.27) (xy 412.75 382.27)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "948be05a-e7b0-56f2-904a-84f1b6ef84ec"))
  (wire (pts (xy 426.72 382.27) (xy 433.07 382.27)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "9d5684c6-376f-5298-a92f-9c87b4a4933d"))
  (text "NMR RX (section A) — clocks, tuned tank, LNA, blanking, I/Q commutating mixer, IF" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 14 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "bb1910c4-161c-58aa-b00e-ca09e72a37df"))
  (text "Design coil: 400 turns AWG26, 4 cm x 10 cm, L = 2.53 mH, R_DC = 6.7 R. Tuned with 1.25 nF at f_Larmor = 89.4 kHz (B0 = 2.1 mT): X_L = 1419 R, R_p = Q*X_L = 14.2 kOhm at Q = 10, tank noise 15.3 nV/rtHz, signal 40 uV pk (v0.7 NMR circuits doc section 0)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 19 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3d387144-de46-5a10-99d5-449f89248413"))
  (text "LNA: the source impedance is 14.2 kOhm, so CURRENT noise decides. OPA1656 (FET, 6 fA/rtHz) gives NF = 0.15 dB; the OPA1612 (1.7 pA/rtHz) would cost 5.5 dB = 3.5x more averages. Gain 101 x 10 = 1000 puts 40 mV pk at the mixer and 1.02 V pk on the ADC (section 3.2 / 4.3)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 22.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e049fa8d-ad95-595f-abf7-b9ce97ddc834"))
  (text "Blanking sits BETWEEN the stages: 60 pC of DG419 charge injection lands on C720 = 10 nF as 6 mV, not on the 1.25 nF tank as 48 mV. Interstage coupling 10 nF / 10 k = 1.59 kHz, so the receiver recovers in 0.3 ms instead of the 300 ms a 1 uF / 100 k would need (section 3.3). RX_BLANK: 0 = blanked (default, 10 k pull-down R724), 1 = receive — an un-driven GPIO leaves the receiver blanked." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2ad55d2c-a04d-5127-9cd7-95303ff4a422"))
  (text "Quadrature LO: the Si5351 phase register cannot do 90 deg below 4.72 MHz (PHOFF is 7 bit in units of T_VCO/4, AN619 section 6). U702 is a 2-bit Johnson counter on CLK1 = 4*f_LO: FF1 D = /Q2, FF2 D = Q1 -> LO_I and LO_Q exactly 90 deg apart at any frequency (section 1.4). Pulse /CLR after every PLLB change so the counter always starts in state 00." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 28.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "801f995e-3349-5cf6-be5b-bd5d159621e1"))
  (text "Mixer supply is +3V3A, NOT +5VA: the TS5A23157 needs V_IH = 0.7*V+ = 3.5 V at 5 V, which a 3.3 V CMOS LO never meets; at 3.3 V it is 2.31 V with 1.0 V of margin (section 4.1). FB901 + 10 uF + 100 nF make +3V3A from +3V3." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 31.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fc9dd73f-4ab9-5ccd-ad6a-e02877ccdb45"))
  (text "Double-balanced commutator: U901 switches S+/S- into COM (I+ and Q+), U902 the same with the inputs swapped (I- and Q-). The difference amplifiers (G = 20, 0.1 % thin film -> CMRR 54 dB) reject V_MID and the LO-synchronous charge injection; the reference leg returns to AGND so COND_OUT1/2 are centred on 0 V for the ADC's +-5.12 V range (section 4.2)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 35 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9619ea4c-71f2-5612-9078-0859ad49a0fb"))
  (text "Grounding (section 8): everything analog on AGND, including U702 (which runs from +3V3A) and the switches, so the commutation instants share the signal ground. The Si5351 is on GND; the single line that crosses is CLK1, damped by R704 / C706. AGND meets GND only at NT1 on the base sheet." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 38.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5c9b3669-1298-573a-bad0-ae85c0e0a0ac"))
  (text "1 — CLOCKS: Si5351A (I2C 0x60) + 74HC74 Johnson quadrature divider" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 50 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9fda68f3-de16-532d-b998-0a187f1f7403"))
  (text "C9006 is a 12 pF crystal: XTAL_CL = 10 pF internal + 4 pF on each of XA/XB = 2 pF external" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 158 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7c82eb06-9110-56b8-8127-ce90b0c0ff09"))
  (text "U702 = 74HC74D,653 dual D flip-flop as a 2-bit Johnson counter. Pins: 1/13 /CLR, 2/12 D, 3/11 CLK," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 140 145 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "59f8ff81-5507-582a-aa42-b2ea2c1c8610"))
  (text "4/10 /PRE, 5/9 Q, 6/8 /Q, 7 GND, 14 VCC. States 00 -> 10 -> 11 -> 01: LO_Q lags LO_I by exactly 90 deg." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 140 148.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7605f9d3-c415-5a1f-9702-9dc2bffbfc04"))
  (text "+3V3A — analog 3.3 V for U702 / U901 / U902 (section 4.1)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 235 60 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4805f7f1-26fe-5aff-bfc5-0aebd107568a"))
  (text "CLK2 = spare clock / scope trigger" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 283 131 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "40638daf-b2bc-57de-8db6-b9cfc68d4fcd"))
  (text "Decoupling: C703/C704 VDD, C705 VDDO (Si5351, GND); C707 U702, C906/C907/C908 +3V3A (AGND);" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 398 45 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6f6a48c9-847b-5394-837a-246dc2d7e92e"))
  (text "C722-C727 U703/U704 +-12 V, C916-C919 U705/U706 +-12 V (all AGND). C905 = 10 uF on +3V3A." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 398 48.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5aa67bde-62e8-59e6-827b-0d215f67a66f"))
  (text "2 — RECEIVER: crossed-diode limiter, tuned tank, OPA1656 x1000, DG419 blanking" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 170 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7c1dfb0c-f230-5dfa-8dc4-b9c0aba33db9"))
  (text "RX = link pin 37 (panel SMA, receive coil). D703/D704 and their AGND return sit within 5 mm of the pin." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 178 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d6b91314-8e2f-59f6-8044-217a1dcd2820"))
  (text "Stage 1: G = 1 + R712/R713 = 1 + 10 000/100 = 101" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 78 214 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "642f799f-986f-59ab-b147-453987efe757"))
  (text "Stage 2: G = 1 + R722/R723 = 1 + 9090/1000 = 10.0" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 78 256 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3cd9c054-c10a-53a8-ab5c-ccabd6f1a368"))
  (text "DG419: logic 0 -> SW1 on, so RX_BLANK = 0 ties the stage-2 input (D) to AGND = BLANKED." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 150 248 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "446f420e-b21f-5e28-be94-f9b90757173c"))
  (text "VL = +5VA (V_IH = 2.4 V, so a 3.3 V CMOS drive has 0.9 V of margin); V+/V- = +-12 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 150 251.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2e5a7ca7-1369-5340-8761-d3f962e53e88"))
  (text "RX_BLANK: 0 = blanked (default, 10 k pull-down), 1 = receive." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 150 254.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3ee9cda2-c223-54ab-88a6-64eb443064f1"))
  (text "R724 goes to AGND, not to +3V3 as the design document's netlist table says: logic 0 blanks, so only a" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 150 257.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0630a17f-51fd-5ee7-b72a-51b40fdab548"))
  (text "pull-DOWN gives the blanked-by-default the same document asks for in section 3.3 (instructor, 2026-09-13)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 150 260.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4531860d-28c2-501e-8e17-9ea32be7048e"))
  (text "JP701: AUX -> LNA input (1-2), or AUX to AGND (2-3). Open by default." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40 290 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4b1161af-f904-51a8-b13e-273769bcc559"))
  (text "JP702: stage-1 feedback select. 1-2 bridged (default) = R712, G = 101; cut and bridge 2-3 = R714, G = 11." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 140 290 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ab6ac8a3-f291-5694-a46f-edb7c0860228"))
  (text "JP703 is in series with the R723 ground leg: cut it and stage 2 becomes a unity follower (G = 1)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 140 293.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b547c676-8485-59d8-819c-546a10c25953"))
  (text "Tank: C710 1.2 nF + C711 100 pF + C712 22 pF = 1.322 nF of pads; stuff to the 1.25 nF the coil needs." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 340 168 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3aa5c49b-d17b-591f-b1c8-ddbdf1d09476"))
  (text "Preferred practice is to tune AT THE COIL: 1 m of RG174 adds ~100 pF = 8 % detune." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 340 171.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "12e3aa79-30a5-5beb-9b45-d30bc73817d9"))
  (text "3 — I/Q COMMUTATING MIXER AND IF (9xx): double-balanced, both switch packages used" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 297 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0f738be6-b168-5189-8351-1b9c17445e28"))
  (text "U705A: unity-gain inverter, S- = -S+" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 33 326 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "678a9b38-28a7-5e54-8f12-8602426ba74f"))
  (text "U705B: V_MID = 1.65 V buffer (R903/R904 from +3V3A), R905 = 100 R in series out" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 115 326 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b22c25f9-cc5b-55e1-bfdc-3a8e2f048920"))
  (text "U901 = I+ / Q+  (NO = S+, NC = S-)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 298 336 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6e0362bd-e7cf-53f5-9be2-87d6cfa7e8cc"))
  (text "U902 = I- / Q-  (inputs SWAPPED: NO = S-, NC = S+)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 393 336 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e0858764-a4a9-51c9-8a71-f8d755b49eba"))
  (text "U706A: I difference amp, G = 20 -> COND_OUT1 (JP101, ADC ch 7)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 460 302 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3db788e0-241b-53ab-85f3-3a12bc0b6fce"))
  (text "U706B: Q difference amp, G = 20 -> COND_OUT2 (JP102, ADC ch 8)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 460 337 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "05d3300f-b337-591e-a0c0-f22d99af5abf"))
  (text "V_MID = 1.65 V, made by U705B; PWR_FLAG because no power_output pin drives it" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 331 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2f851697-219e-5ce0-ac56-099c4812c34b"))
  (text "D905-D908: BAV99 clamps to AGND / +3V3A — the LNA runs on +-12 V" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 120 330 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "63f6270d-40af-5d4e-914b-d88cf92bd00f"))
  (text "and must not push the switch inputs outside 0..3.3 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 120 333.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ae80cfc0-025f-579e-ad5e-be3d567f712c"))
